{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>From sheaves, sheaves.</b> As in the matter of a dream — it rose to greatness and he became ruler, as it is written: ״ויצבור יוסף בר״ etc." "<b>And bowed down to my sheaf.</b> It is a sign that the world will look forward to his produce, for he provides for all the people of the land."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:39.748987698Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}